    [38;5;153mloginSpec[39m and one [38;5;153mbindForm[39m call. [38;5;153mlogin()[39m and [38;5;153mAPI_ENDPOINT[39m untouched.
  - [38;5;153mindex.html[39m — [38;5;153mname[39m attributes on the two inputs; [38;5;153m<script>[39m gains [38;5;153mtype="module"[39m.

